  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm của tam giác đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Hình chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Áp dụng định lý Py-ta-go <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>33</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Thể tích khối chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>33</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>11</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/9cf8924773c0887ff3b2938d5b20b61b6512d74a6c1e1cf3aa1c95c993fd8e7d.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
